Third-party notice

The backup-file layout used by this project was derived from the "hpd20"
project by Jürgen Schwietering (https://github.com/scjurgen/hpd-20), published
under the MIT licence. The instrument-name table was generated from that
project's data, which in turn lists the instrument names of the Roland
HandSonic HPD-20.

Roland, HandSonic, D-BEAM and V-Drums are trademarks of Roland Corporation.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Roland.

Loading a backup file into an HPD-20 erases every setting on the instrument.
Use this software at your own risk and keep a copy of any original file.
